<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>’Mid rending rocks and darkening skies</l><l>My Savior bows His head and dies;</l><l>The opening veil reveals the way</l><l>To life divine and endless day.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Jesus, Lord, how can it be</l><l>That Thou shouldst give Thy life for me,</l><l>To bear the cross and agony</l><l>In that dread hour on Calvary!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
